      "exercise": "161",
      "source": "derived",
      "grading": "auto",
      "displayAnswer": "以下均为实数解，各小问的解按 x 从小到大排列。\na) $(-4\\sqrt{5},2\\sqrt{5}),\\ (-4,-2),\\ (4,2),\\ (4\\sqrt{5},-2\\sqrt{5})$。\nb) $(-3,-2),\\ (3,2)$。\nc) $(3-3\\sqrt{2},3+3\\sqrt{2}),\\ (2,4),\\ (4,2),\\ (3+3\\sqrt{2},3-3\\sqrt{2})$。\nd) $(2,3),\\ (3,2)$。",
      "parts": [
        {"label": "a) 第1组 x（按 x 递增）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-4\\sqrt{5}"], "displayAnswer": "$-4\\sqrt{5}$"},
        {"label": "a) 第1组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2\\sqrt{5}"], "displayAnswer": "$2\\sqrt{5}$"},
        {"label": "a) 第2组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-4"], "displayAnswer": "$-4$"},
        {"label": "a) 第2组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-2"], "displayAnswer": "$-2$"},
        {"label": "a) 第3组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["4"], "displayAnswer": "$4$"},
        {"label": "a) 第3组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"},
        {"label": "a) 第4组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["4\\sqrt{5}"], "displayAnswer": "$4\\sqrt{5}$"},
        {"label": "a) 第4组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-2\\sqrt{5}"], "displayAnswer": "$-2\\sqrt{5}$"},
        {"label": "b) 第1组 x（按 x 递增）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-3"], "displayAnswer": "$-3$"},
        {"label": "b) 第1组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["-2"], "displayAnswer": "$-2$"},
        {"label": "b) 第2组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3"], "displayAnswer": "$3$"},
        {"label": "b) 第2组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"},
        {"label": "c) 第1组 x（按 x 递增）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3-3\\sqrt{2}"], "displayAnswer": "$3-3\\sqrt{2}$"},
        {"label": "c) 第1组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3+3\\sqrt{2}"], "displayAnswer": "$3+3\\sqrt{2}$"},
        {"label": "c) 第2组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"},
        {"label": "c) 第2组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["4"], "displayAnswer": "$4$"},
        {"label": "c) 第3组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["4"], "displayAnswer": "$4$"},
        {"label": "c) 第3组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"},
        {"label": "c) 第4组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3+3\\sqrt{2}"], "displayAnswer": "$3+3\\sqrt{2}$"},
        {"label": "c) 第4组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3-3\\sqrt{2}"], "displayAnswer": "$3-3\\sqrt{2}$"},
        {"label": "d) 第1组 x（按 x 递增）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"},
        {"label": "d) 第1组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3"], "displayAnswer": "$3$"},
        {"label": "d) 第2组 x", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3"], "displayAnswer": "$3$"},
        {"label": "d) 第2组 y", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["2"], "displayAnswer": "$2$"}
      ],
      "notes": "a) x=2y 和 x=-2y 都有实解；b) x=-3y/2 分支无实解；c) xy=8 和 xy=-9 都有实解；d) x+y=-3 时判别式为 -47，无实解。数字坐标按明确顺序分别作答，不把多个解当作任选一个。"
