    {
      "exercise": "162",
      "source": "derived",
      "grading": "auto",
      "displayAnswer": "a) 原分数的分子为 $8$，分母为 $12$，即 $\\frac{8}{12}$，其值为 $\\frac{2}{3}$。验证：$\\frac{10}{15}=\\frac{2}{3}$，$\\frac{9}{18}=\\frac12=\\frac23-\\frac16$。\nb) 原分数为 $\\frac35$。验证：$\\frac48=\\frac12$，$\\frac26\\cdot\\frac35=\\frac15$。另一个代数候选为分子 $0$、分母 $-1$，但变换后的分母为 $0$，故不成立。",
      "parts": [
        {"label": "a) 原分子（不约分）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["8"], "displayAnswer": "$8$"},
        {"label": "a) 原分母（不约分）", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["12"], "displayAnswer": "$12$"},
        {"label": "b) 原分子", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["3"], "displayAnswer": "$3$"},
        {"label": "b) 原分母", "judge": "numeric", "expected": ["5"], "displayAnswer": "$5$"}
      ],
      "notes": "保留原分子分母而不是只给约分后的值；所有出现的分母须非零。"
    },
